  "body": "## What changed\n\nA ribbon cell painted its fill and took clicks in a box of `cell_h` (30 px). The label sits at `glyph_px + 2` below the cell top. The shipped themes (`horizon-day`, `teal-night`) set `glyph_px` to 22. Thus the label ran from 24 px to about 38 px, and the fill covered only the top half of the label. This occurred for a toggled cell, a hovered cell, and a toggled cell under the pointer. The built-in tables overflow by about 2 px.\n\n- `ribbon_cell::cell_box` extends the fill and the click target down to the label bottom. The box stops 2 px above the group caption row.\n- A filled cell writes its label in `contrast::on_fill(fill)`, the same ink as its glyph. A cell without a fill keeps `text` / `text_faint`.\n- `cell` and `fit_label` move from `painted.rs` (468 lines) to the new `ribbon_cell.rs`. `painted.rs` re-exports `cell`, so the callers do not change. `painted.rs` is now 370 lines.\n- The ribbon layout (`cell_h`, `ribbon_h`, the rows) does not change.\n\nDecision record: `docs/decisions/2752-ribbon-cell-fill.md`.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n`crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/ribbon_cell_fill.rs`:\n\n- `a_filled_cell_holds_its_whole_label_in_each_theme`: DARK, LIGHT and the two shipped themes; toggled, hovered, toggled and hovered. The fill holds the label. This test fails on `main` (checked: the fill ends above the label bottom).\n- `a_filled_cell_writes_its_label_in_the_on_fill_ink`\n- `the_cell_box_stops_clear_of_the_caption_row`\n\n## Readings\n\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 9 steps, 0 failed (ui lib, boundary, boundary_picks, sinker_setup, tap_hand, theme_example, theme_files, waterjet_tool).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No pixel snapshot was made again. The snapshot PNGs are release-lane. The label ink on a filled cell changes, and the fill is taller in the shipped themes. Expect a `.diff.png` for a ribbon with a toggled cell at the cut.\n- I did not look at the change in a windowed run.\n\n## Screenshots\n\nBefore (`main`) and after (this PR), headless render at 2x. The Inspect group has Paths toggled on.\n\n<img width=\"938\" height=\"618\" alt=\"Ribbon Paths cell before and after the fix\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6bbebaae-11aa-4309-a648-33f5cb9e653b\" />\n\nChangelog: A toggled or hovered ribbon button fills behind its whole label in each theme, and its label uses the same ink as its icon (#2752)\n\nFixes #2752\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n",
